    {
      "id": "2a8309eb-0719-4184-9eb4-1ccae63230cb",
      "title": "Escute duas respostas curtas e note o que muda em cada uma.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "c322a40e-f64f-4ed3-9b55-d92b0faf62a7",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Me llamo Lara.</strong></p><p>Meu nome é Lara.</p><p>Só o nome muda. O começo da frase continua igual.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/bab48a95879c45869edf49adbe1e6050_l02b04-me-llamo-lara.mp3?Expires=1794099393&Signature=f6gqa7peY1WxF48G2YOk3ufsmGWZrIP-RM3DoIsWxyFfiRJuSnhpwLX3Ru6cXC~hhQH-VS26CDqfgjos4bsV1SrK804UzkCJYJHiuNprBwkFg41GUyoIZoUbH58xy5tX4K6VDmGov0vmZxKo3KKVic3JQdBdJrQTHjqJdZTm8j0ttQl7oPkotPjsD9T4qvIfmKmps-0fzwo98D4zT9olM-nmwas8K1yPA0g3eayKRKW2alhxea4sqaLognZTULXqPc0F7g0Nv7AYVqVp7nTWSeoec9eCoy418KCU4~r9UN5FzNHEHjxLMrG8kfXV3Nk4XZEg-kfdNDb1mG3UaMREXg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "66a0fc27-2adb-4262-9bd6-d8645e47468e",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Me llamo Bruno.</strong></p><p>Meu nome é Bruno.</p><p>Você reaproveita a mesma forma com outro nome.</p>",
