    {
      "id": "1616cff4-7b58-450b-9118-a24f44dd4442",
      "title": "Compare as partes em negrito e observe o padrão que se repete.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "2abadf4d-9727-4c41-878b-e481f0b58784",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe o contraste principal da aula.</p><ul><li><strong>¿Cómo te llamas?</strong> para perguntar</li><li><strong>Me llamo Bruno.</strong> para responder</li></ul><p>Nas duas formas aparece <strong>llam-</strong>. O que muda é a parte que indica de quem é o nome: <strong>te llamas</strong> (você) e <strong>me llamo</strong> (eu).</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f17bbfc1-3dd9-4ee2-b33f-aa6008e768f9",
      "title": "Escute a frase e observe que agora a fala é sobre outra pessoa.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "1d0e6921-5296-407d-943d-e02fc37495cb",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Se llama Bruno.</strong></p><p>Ele se chama Bruno.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/6d8cf6967d6e4944b6806707a9b343c6_l02b07-se-llama-bruno.mp3?Expires=1794099393&Signature=1PqlupVPQV8ALOUKSmbl6TVPEVupQ4chP9Ef6nV3fXHXnwkmfwxbL9QpoCnSKUU7MW2MfArCxJoz4d02~iJDg2sy1PfzGi4gKJX7f1oOtrE9m~rPji0gY~YsuxHsossaMT~haqSaE1tAqFGptDBfpoL3CMZMgwalpQMFtnUYcmDKZJ5Ot6WbzbUODOoMwYSWAeSJruAb9UCvbziHLmrhTfyxMde5vyKgT~EGHmhdyV9R4N9Kh3KIyC5b7gCF4vAeLKeGkZMIz0nidupoJj-GOTcf29yUWEgVqJN-72Njz~W9yp3oY99W5xATmMzvpm~SUOpd4NnGQZiPLfJ3LKFl3Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
