          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/7aad865b00f741ecbbe2f2ac0cc319b5_l02-primeiro-contato-na-aula.png?Expires=1794099393&Signature=LBdOCILwHjhvH~do9X46nmze56LwJ0KNewM43Z97QDlRPcRRc5Jp8hM~3wTfqA3LU8hgvgzRoMGdOXXltFwjV~m9Z3ouFkVPk46eQYDpNEEPMAyGqE8ZEHSqKiBPUh9itCcjAvk66rzIkmb9x6gKWD2VFwpdrNVVldxEoqj6R-VqGuBEizQU5HbOUiYbuTSJ2aoCgROxKuyO~sXREajqbRcXt5rKt7dAo1ooxsOiFQwPN8YbBQG8vdzlPeyYH1uA-jOldn5kJsMTMZddOMTgsjSQT9Txa1kPJ1YE4J0yn3g8eAdslxnG3s7R51sNN2C3-BtHfv9GS23yjR9YakD9QQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
